ath d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><h3 id=\"chapter-11\">Polity and title</h3><p>The titles, the offices, and how the polity is named.</p><div class=\"tile-footer\"><span>Read</span><span>→</span></div></a><a class=\"portal-tile\" href=\"/library.html#documents\"><div class=\"tile-top\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">8 documents</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><h3 id=\"chapter-12\">The written record</h3><p>The kingdom, the clans, the burial canon, the temples — readable in full.</p><div class=\"tile-footer\"><span>Read</span><span>→</span></div></a><a class=\"portal-tile\" href=\"/gallery.html\"><div class=\"tile-top\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">69 photographs</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><h3 id=\"chapter-13\">The gallery</h3><p>The instruments, the dress and the architecture, in photographs.</p><div class=\"tile-footer\"><span>Read</span><span>→</span></div></a><a class=\"portal-tile\" href=\"/odiana.html\"><div class=\"tile-top\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">9 documents</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><h3 id=\"chapter-14\">Odiana</h3><p>The religion of the Igbo, read in the Ide dialect.</p><div class=\"tile-footer\"><span>Read</span><span>→</span></div></a></div></div></section></article>\n</main>"}